1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Bangladesh ready-made garment exporters face an urgent double squeeze: EU apparel shipments declined 11.9%, while domestic gas tariffs surged over 200%.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:27,500
At our pilot facility in Gazipur, 18 Modbus RTU meters continuously monitor thermal boilers, stenters, and rooftop solar under strict European buyer caps.

3
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:39,000
CarbonLoom's vision ingestion extracts consumption, meter identifiers, and tariffs from bilingual Bengali DESCO electricity invoices with 98.5% confidence into auditable JSON.

4
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:53,700
All telemetry and utility records flow through an eight-server zero-trust Go gateway, enforcing tenant isolation, Modbus CRC verification, and blocking prompt injection in under 25 milliseconds.

5
00:00:53,700 --> 00:01:07,500
Our digital twin factory simulator tracks live wattage and gas enthalpy. When an uncharacteristic spike occurs, an Isolation Forest model flags a critical anomaly score of 0.84.

6
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:20,000
TreeSHAP feature attribution pinpoints 84% of excess waste directly to a steam-trap leak on Boiler 1, automatically proposing a CMMS repair ticket gated by a supervisor token.

7
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:32,500
Bilingual GraphRAG grounds factory queries in official European Union directives, linking EU CBAM Annex IV and ESPR Article 7 directly to factory equipment.

8
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:45,000
When presented with speculative queries such as ten-year carbon price forecasts, corrective RAG triggers strict refusal, guaranteeing zero mathematical or regulatory hallucinations.

9
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:01,100
Using deterministic standard minute value allocation, we calculate exactly 1.412 kilograms of CO2e per garment, co-signed by an ISO 14064 lead auditor on Hyperledger Fabric.

10
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:14,500
In the Public Buyer Portal, global customs and brand buyers verify Groth16 zero-knowledge proofs in under 142 milliseconds via WebAssembly, shielding factory trade secrets.

11
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:27,800
If an adversary attempts to modify the carbon figure from 1.412 to 1.112 kg, both the Fabric Merkle root and Groth16 elliptic pairing checks immediately fail red with tamper alarms.

12
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:40,300
With three enterprise tiers from Factory Starter to Buyer Enterprise, CarbonLoom pays for itself in under 4.2 months through avoided utility waste and CBAM tariff penalties.

13
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:54,000
Backed by verifiable provenance audit trails, 22 passing test suites, and zero prompt math, CarbonLoom delivers industrial decarbonization from concept to production.
